    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25855" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapsăna</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lampsăna</span></b> ), ae,
		f. (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapsănium</span></b> , ii, n., Hier.
		ap. Reg. S. Pachom. 52), = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαψάνη</span> and
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμψάνη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an edible plant, charlock</i>, Sinapis
			arvensis, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 9, 37, § 96</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 16, 25</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 2,
			25</span></i>.—Prov.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapsanā vivere,</span>”
				<i>to live on a meagre diet</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 41, § 144</span></i>
			.</div>
